    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/veterinary-services/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Veterinary Services Theme is a versatile, free, and professional solution tailored for veterinary clinics, animal hospitals, pet care centers, veterinary practices, animal wellness clinics, pet grooming services, pet boarding facilities, pet nutrition services, pet surgery centers, animal rescue organizations, pet treatment providers, animal therapy centers, pet emergency services, veterinary offices, and animal medicine providers. Designed to create a polished and engaging online presence, this theme includes a dynamic Home Page Slider to highlight key services, promotions, or featured pets, as well as dedicated sections for Pet Care, Pet Grooming, Pet Boarding, and Special Services to showcase your clinic’s offerings. The Our Team section helps introduce veterinary staff, building trust with clients, while the Blog Section provides a platform for sharing pet care tips, updates, and news. Fully responsive, retina-ready, and SEO-friendly, the theme ensures a seamless experience across all devices. For enhanced functionality, it integrates with the Bookly plugin, enabling clients to schedule appointments, manage consultations, and streamline veterinary services online, making it a complete solution for pet care businesses. Demo: https://preview.wpradiant.net/veterinary-services/"
    },
